    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d353-a5">

                <pb facs="0547" n="453" xml:id="pg453"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mascarenas to Mr. George.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nogales, Ariz.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-06"><hi rendition="#italic">March 6,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I have the honor of asking of you to
                    inform me, if you have no objection, of the manner in which was delivered on the
                    24th last July to our authorities the Mexican citizen Jesus Garcia, imprisoned
                    wrongly by the American police force of Nogales, Ariz.</p>
                <p>I will be obliged to you also if you let me know the items that you might
                    know.</p>
                <p>I take occasion to renew you the securities of my distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Mascarenas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
